    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0505-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "The most commonly prescribed form of buprenorphine is absorbed via the sublingual \nroute. Each tablet takes approximately 5–10 minutes to disintegrate and be absorbed. \nIt is effective in treating opioid dependence because:\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88999938964844,
        374.7632751464844,
        436.6999816894531,
        410.4832763671875
