        428.4832763671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d87106850d3244aa2d7afbfeec7e4db343b7588e283993d3db9df8c29b3ed214"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0505-block-0030",
      "order": 30,
      "text": "■\n■It reduces the effects of additional opioid use because of its high receptor affinity – \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88990020751953,
        428.7633056640625,
        436.679931640625,
        440.4833068847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "47967e2ae10707d1805c39527867f10b97db7149743fa4c162f4f45b7eedd7d5"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0505-block-0031",
      "order": 31,
      "text": "what patients refer to as a ‘blocking’ effect.16–18\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88999938964844,
        440.7633056640625,
