      "order": 33,
      "text": "related to the buprenorphine dose administered: low doses (e.g. 2mg) exert effects for \nup to 12 hours; higher doses (e.g. 16–32mg) exert effects for as long as 48–72 hours, \nallowing thrice weekly dosing.\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88999938964844,
